{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1567,
  "batch_count": 1682,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "f1c6893d60a8989361cfd9c371f56bc8ec25f81d",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98012913177ebb51414c5ff1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是命运啊！我正想尝试换穿各种衣服呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b3538a24d502d35c09864e12020238208b802259e993388cff9580af8e2285c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f41bd79e05cb93ebe276ada",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是什么衣服，我都能以最棒的姿态\r\n驾驭给你看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f5b9c2e900c134662c1869084077eae9369c1977fca27d10ff6764ff7e6aadc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:094698964ed1ff8e10f763ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "便于活动是绝对不可动摇的条件！\r\n只要穿上就会忍不住想跑出去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fee88efd234e5c44d52f09203b3a04d480bb5e3eaa6fc04054d003fff432e4ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcd93c074814a2c37e38506f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去高山还是深谷，又或者是大海！？来吧，要去哪！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "63021eb8cf2265fd5ab4782fcf8abaffcf0c866fffe21a6370f1303f83b2ae14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4660d1d74d8009df05579d70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢制服！因为这能让我\r\n深切感受到自己的使命与命运！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48c06c275be017291ad2c1a51f1eeb314231c7490ba23af2c2e26ce68ff530bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af4dd3ea970b157e5aa0f457",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想跳舞了吗！？既然如此，\r\n赶紧把音乐放起来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a31bc50b7c3be20d51fe68b054fda58c5d1625c0de3428a0daa2c003a46d55d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44d9b504cdb4fc1e1031d735",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是比任何恒星都要闪耀的胜负服！\r\n一旦跑起来，大家的命运也会被一同照亮！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59f92059388b00512c30a0c2f22d7baec75ff387a6fb036c175832d8531462e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:211087190927cabc532f0f3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是蹦是跳还是飞扑\r\n都绝对不会破，真是靠得住的搭档！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03437d46b9c5b672dd9a8ef91110da8f1f987f8e50d1a4f7f8a9ec32991b8b12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb7d5edde4522d9755e5a5ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "凭借我这么响亮的脚步声，\r\n用舞步当场演奏乐曲也是完全可行的呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6ad4f01d4246922dd69f4072ceff2a9f5649bcfd319ac42df81ddd4cf0bff8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5adbbb0a1fed25958bee560",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奔跑时斗篷迎风猎猎作响的声音！\r\n简直让人欲罢不能啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bec26106dd3032951286e25705bebf2ca6221910d147c1de2e4cd0110d59c5e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94d8eca70e2d2ede7cfbd445",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是命运啊！我正想尝试换穿各种衣服呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b3538a24d502d35c09864e12020238208b802259e993388cff9580af8e2285c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79bf803cb8649650f78d8ab6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是什么衣服，我都能以最棒的姿态\r\n驾驭给你看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f5b9c2e900c134662c1869084077eae9369c1977fca27d10ff6764ff7e6aadc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5274fd6776cf0a0332bd345",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0f70d041ed0d8780cf21a3fb1a7856a20c5dd25dd2287abaff00cfb80bed392",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0efdefcb0f3b45b92c4fab4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好不容易开始了新的一天，\r\n睡眼惺忪发懵可太浪费了！\r\n来吧，今天你想做些什么！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dba49c6fb97719fff381f8edc6c48a50193ce698753b58f71f8bd9f29e1867c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:289b6f794e79bec3fd300db7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闹钟？我才不用呢！自然醒的时间！\n那就是当天我的命运！\n也是最完美的时刻！",
      "source_fingerprint": "91a2dd845b27e1b5b9105b0d874a449b1a6978952d886c15e9d57d20638ed459",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b108f972de33f388a0cf549",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "食堂推出了期间限定的甜品哦！\r\n肚子饿了吗？\r\n哎呀甜品是用另一个胃装的啦！走起！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e76420711e33bc063609eb2bef7e8201a2053fde909a41d27c384d89466cacda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49e00f8a3fd718d67d89436d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午休是为了什么而存在的？\r\n当然是为了痛痛快快找乐子啊！躲避球吗！\r\n还是抓人游戏！什么我都奉陪到底！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5272420c1ef08e737e763dafadb99e36f0e94b876f424b352b7e7e59a476b6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97ef31eb99ac07f9cc1fd6e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哪有那么容易睡得着啊！\r\n今天还没做完想做的事！明天要做的事！\r\n脑子里接二连三不断冒出来呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "136234a36095cdbffe2ab5176a33c89a0a854c6efe5a698f95c33785754f6b06",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1245c1c2c9a9c28d9989d54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吉兆吩咐过晚上要安静！\n这可是个好机会！我早就想试一次\n在完全无声的状态下能做到多少事了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f7629c2f04fe69ebe5ffe65cb021e98aa28a00788a197789282c12302a48ae7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b09f96df21902994d457789e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家快醒醒！！……啊，我是在呼唤\n还在冬眠中的生物啦！因为想让它们\n早点沐浴在这明媚春光里嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9033e4c2e7b3fdafa00589c68cd2857405440170f0b70e0148fb8cb723aec54b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7a1ad8f8cefa3e39a33610c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然大家都喊热死了热死了，但我倒挺\r\n喜欢的！就像是在与我体内的\r\n澎湃热情相互呼应一样不是吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "586dc1a48b16c9e440ad72349c508bc19ab4fcc6e79ebc925f9bfbf618838e05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0202e0dc230c25ba26c8cebf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好吃！太好吃了！吃什么都超美味！\r\n真不愧是食欲之秋――\r\n呃不对，我平时好像一直都这样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5630b042a44c8f260e533f7dc99b4b62e8c1293109af4c9f038f48c2dde9beb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b44c045f0903136eda367ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经堆了十个以上的雪人了！\r\n广场上那个你的雪雕，\r\n就是我的杰作哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c9239d6b8346b0cde771327c2e44dbc21628989b089d69be4d3e604b9d06ec8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ce61ab4c0d237a22e7066c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是情人节呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8011f857668e7c25b58f43684d5f04380b92a8f2c1bd4bec6cdbb800ee7f0572",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15573e92edb3317041e85181",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "标志可是个巧手能人啊～！不管是鞋子\n还是衣服，只要有一点损坏，\n经她修理后甚至比坏掉前还要精致漂亮！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf877eadf61833aca81eceaf48a039c0dd76f5b75b82f9618dd2fd236f22f8ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:834606820ca51de19d6b56c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的尾巴和耳朵毛，是不是在\n闪闪发亮？嘿嘿，刚才西沙里奥\n帮我打理梳顺过了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "359de925a9098e39151212e6882615f1389f3c96674453b86023b58e94693595",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1548cf878458d48d968d29e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吉兆在赛事以外的地方也是我的师父呢！\n就算是我练习骑自行车的特训，\n她也会一直默默在旁守护着我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "320ac5880d58f51e6455656d5e5aa9431dd13639c80c412e819832c07526d604",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c104ad013332d630801511c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "统治地位可是桌游高手哦！不仅实力超强，\r\n对战时脸上还会变换各种各样的表情，\r\n看得人超级开心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2846d019e1be80277b084333688d65a46c88fc03cef044e71f3f16a0ebe5b6fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdfa9ab356f7ff570c8b2901",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论小乐身在何处，当她陷入烦恼时，\n不可思议的是我总能察觉到！每到那种时候\n我就会跑去告诉她：只要勇往直前就好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "819b503a273d2beb75d9ba20b384a2c68caef89bc6abd2eb033ba86dae292042",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e1844fb6b95934e194838eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跳舞时犹豫不决可是大忌！要把内心的\r\n激动与雀跃直接化作动作！\r\n只有这样，才能真正打动别人的心扉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "575ae5294728c35573739404d601b0c5e62668ff0fe675b0024df0c496726155",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88c3c51dd769d720aa0ef2be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算有不擅长跳舞的孩子也没关系！\r\n我会站在旁边为她打着节拍引领她的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "57b66cac85d779d6d779db69f8d2c46ede81dd415d3f0b7fc633db73c45a4be8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2298a6c2ab8c78bf0168368",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "衣服刚寄到的时候，我特意跑去展示给\n西沙里奥和吉兆看了呢！\n当然，收获了她们的绝赞好评！",
      "source_fingerprint": "510cde45dc369b9aa414796858a22db179c74bbb8a4026b8a5bfc37bb8a7ee32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa0938848e67055d536f6a98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很有强者的风范对吧？但是，\r\n这可不是为了君临众人之上而穿的衣服！\r\n而是为了指引带领大家前行的服饰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f32a018ccf226b76b377257456b3d200eb3e272f8770533d31435fec9fa2246f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94c0dd2ecd64cac7b8a8b371",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯！还没睡醒吗！？既然如此，\r\n就用我专属的叫醒服务吧！看我\r\n把你背在背上绕学院狂飙十圈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "67240aa187d6dd5878bddbf9025956502d250f780bb0451f005d0427398cc377",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7c113f22bffc93b05ef2b64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然很多孩子都说吃完午饭后会犯困……\r\n我完全无法理解！不如说现在的我\r\n体力满格，状态绝佳得不得了吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "91636af3a161727ec51fc06c458368c178255c8975fe0a8d5b1c16a16a70411a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6f8f56178adfc2131f75284",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唯独在晚上走宿舍走廊的时候，\r\n我可是非常小心的！……因为有一次，\r\n我的脚步声把整栋楼的人都吵醒了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a3b8b7a312b98e9fbdae16e8bf838b23fc10ca5b7b7e8b7a479682e1f772d63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58734c626e090ccace5ad6f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年能赏几次花呢？既然到处都\r\n开得这么灿烂壮观！\r\n不统统看个遍的话心里根本过意不去嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f4133d711f2bdb182a1ab6cdf035baeb1242f4c5816a32476cb1e22fda4ac60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fa3c825635a9c48fe113b4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果真有幽灵的话，真希望能见面！\n不管是遗憾还是未解心愿都没关系！\n我绝对会帮它彻底解决的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1da8437db7187b77edfa8c11f8844a3ce582cc02fe30b9ece820d8e9f068ba0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c129b5f0cc5b66b5a960efce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "散落在学园各处的落叶们在呼唤我！\n它们叫我赶紧扫拢起来，堆成一座\n巨大的山！好嘞，包在我身上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7807e36de8bbe99a028c6585def44a7e7b6aaf87131336e7ded0e27238cc821b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39c41e63776b8cbe469bc13c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学园打雪仗争霸联赛开幕啦！\r\n……啊，是我创办的！\r\n你就是我们队伍的副队长哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca23d7ee325f6095f057abb71464cbc2706116aca40f270eeaa3598913d87a29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2abdcb69a41ee1df6ac8e33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等待美好事物的时间真的超级快乐！\r\n因为好想听听你的训练菜单，\r\n我今天一整天都在雀跃不已呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2b88a063d1b4edd34d19bfafb5692775b09c80840403d979b21923aafa64b7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a40769dd71cbb8aedf2aa869",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，从什么开始！？\r\n力量强化吗？速度强化吗？\r\n……还是全都要！？怎么样，我猜中了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f504109d726adf378ef49c45cee5d9e6a56bd0df9d1222cc331b75cf11822940",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d9e1fd7fa3c753ed0739038",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢学园的跑道！\r\n也喜欢学园的健身房！锻炼的时候，\r\n我能听见命运转动的轰鸣声！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcf20e51c16e94309eca6b47d18e754dd08de9e3905ac12d52c2d05c2592b057",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3593a27497283f50d8f227ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧！一如既往地，\r\n在背后推我一把吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ee663f538cfa7e8ccfc1b1853e897cf28d3a59ed09512b4f473a90179420780",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:619c86ccc0eabdf433d93a94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要是你的菜单，我无论什么都会全力\r\n以赴拉满！因为，把这些全都拿下\r\n正是我的命运啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf15a8c9e80d676aa0d2fdcdc4601ad3b1c101f82813739e96806b8bcd62c32e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:651a7c0357874dc3085087ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会拿出超出你预期的成果给你看的！\r\n因为，你惊讶万分的表情，\r\n我超想亲眼见到嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7770735a7ecc26e6ee9c74241670d8f10e60f35b6fec9f1c5b8d7819e1911214",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffe3efb6e8d8f71a3d544aa6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "与你一同奔赴的命运，\r\n绝无止境！无论多远，\r\n无论何方！我们都要一起走下去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "79cc467cef8b7ee7419f7a1e2414682cafcd25ac854139eb7882de2c68232b98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:745adcbd30d712a0669f2b75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……对了！朝着那个太阳\r\n游过去吧！没事的，现在的我\r\n总觉得自己连那里都能游得到！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7134f1efb04c523830863fee73499da65582e0189dd0cda505323f88d4b0608",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db59f20880bebc81c412c3bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "直到无限的尽头，与你一同狂奔！这是最棒的命运！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a05968d75b9c5d8bac5abf66c68b1b0cab9293ee90fe979b09736fb53223aa4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:043c45fc3592cf4285442388",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "借着你的呼喊，无论多高多远我都能展翅高飞！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9058b7b6e8730c784106f2fdae9f4c7b1033be1d14181601efafb6c6efbc074",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e45b16200352913c0265184",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "命运也说了，收集照片把演唱会的气氛炒热起来吧！\r\n既然如此那就赶快行动，马上出发！现在立刻拍个痛快！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a364aa56cea48784ce76ec17f4a8f6e98b8bf88e86370f2eec213f98f0c0fd74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "940000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db2492e410fe188632b83671",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊哈哈！干得漂亮，太棒啦！！\r\n谢礼也有准备好哦！这可是你自己亲手抓住的命运！",
      "source_fingerprint": "733f0584ed018a35d1804e39492c014fa24eb1ecc2e9380771760edc67a5a9f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "940001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a034cc62facd73b8ca32f5ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "未来，将会无限延展！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ec03db5b252bf08597bdbfe1e347a521f2a1e0779767364eff4a01ddf5aa064",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a3084108334ec056fd0bae2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的命运绝无极限！",
      "source_fingerprint": "085c63561d6647c8694d0fdda6baffdc244b664755d6eec881895e539fa866b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f32457067790b14091f6eb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "神威启示！没错，就是我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a39b8c7b8db5ef01d2e7ca0cab4d6d2bd9bae379eeb4744c2a6beace559ff94f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27b6994006a08cfd52c07429",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你还尚不知晓命运……\r\n没关系！现在，就由我来传达给你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ce982c91e340223b7367e1af6ca99eb942651d3a8b9ca70b8ab998cabbda9fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f969240e0c9b3e8b6720de7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起努力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3382cddefb3b5851054894026cb53f29316b7430069927058d0134d0bb83b496",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:553485edbea6b452cb484fb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我相信着。若是和你一起，\n即便在悲伤之雨过后——也一定\n能让大家看见希望的天空。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80ac87ded4148dd31e6e7d87d04d55379b2f77560973e564e5513abbc64fbc0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d58f70d63107a980efb2b575",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba97cb41e2262c84b02d770c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f102281bd0a55259bd28da4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们一同迈步，连结羁绊…。\n正因为你这样对我说过，\n我才觉得自己能治愈所有孤独。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14b2238188883f02e0cc23ba65410f511a9782cf72d33e5857ba50c97c275162",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b1be9124b4e4c8ec13ab029",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "与你之间的连结，为彼此\n带来了幸福…呵呵。愿这奇迹般的\n圆环，永远不会解开。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f7a1c0bf753c72184484d8df566d1ede6a6ee9476006c0ee71d3e45ca7da88c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38d5b72a7125f75f82c1cf3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正月我总是和家人一起度过。\n一边为他们揉肩，一边讲起学园的事，\n父母都会眯起眼睛微笑…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ef21dbe527057ddcd8be65dcdb8fdfe20a85c193075060d578eb01a37d3a57c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c230ae9c38919735345ecc3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我和创升同学、景致同学\n一起做了巧克力。愿笑容的圆环\n能在大家之间扩展开来——",
      "source_fingerprint": "492ade8019d276c865b6b626bd6ceb01c91b65bc61f8d737d135109a95b8861e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72fac732d3dfabc3d4a32cb2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我把对你的心意做成了\n缎带形状的巧克力。愿我们结下的牵绊\n永远不会松开。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aecb835275fea9825de09332e0d0a3a9018f4f094017ef2f42fc48935d91d79b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f949e21c5d9cc4965d94c924",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愿织女和彦星无论何时都能相会——\n愿连结两人的桥梁，\n无论如何都不要消失。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bff2af44ba9eb5ac99f84ac78c7a2fed352840b72ea651373d0dd4c1d40add25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bff0b02da511d9514f15b9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说今天，是已经无法再见的人\n会在一夜之间归来的日子。\n温柔又…总觉得很温暖呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22eb5fe9ac6c14b8bf1232e575c6958bee54ca70bd570e1482dd1d69b59b154e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec134a0df6c46662337700d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我和荣进闪耀同学\n烤了德式姜饼。还聊了\n各种海外点心的事…呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83b3869a43b0b2956d9a1def4ae7ef80be76a105662b192d9d522c48e84bbca7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6aa81a97a41ebc40febcf8c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愿我与你之间的连结，\n也能像装点圣夜的圣诞花环一样…\n一直延续下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c289c46e94b079fe98e47062da4cbca6e317409609f5d7717e40c30b0c96286",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e35137f420b33ac26bdebe8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做到了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32aef7ba1f969ebda52d7bea37a777d96121b1a4336da65f31a44bd63a7c800a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b42cf72da84aeaa57de733cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "年末似乎会有很多人感到寂寞。\n所以我一定会逐一问候大家，\n祈愿他们心中能点起一丝火光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af45d81c3effaf0a00d6a8bfe2afbad2f190c424f1e7b41dca7f4fe07e87dcc3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80ef6711bb2b0d637371603f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝你生日快乐。\n愿今天这个日子，被思念着你的\n笑容之环填满。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f08142c21150203a029f2aabbf45f4e3f3334d8d4790670c9f6b54d9f126c9f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51f3fc44facf5f4985c65f25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能看到你以笑容\n迎来这一刻…。能成为那笑容之环\n的一部分，我感到很高兴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3f371aefe4a51d15ba1592c51808ea036fc26d3d0421938221cbb1403d9d5a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:380c0c69b9f27a60e424c518",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新宇宙同学她们在生日会上\n送了我一块仿宝石的蛋糕♪\n呵呵…吃的时候，我还有些紧张呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2169fd1babc136383ca4e98b21e3fb4d846bd5afbcc47d4511d08f43bf3b74b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c472cead31a89a03d1f4ad8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你能像这样陪在我身边——\n仅仅如此，就让这个日子\n变得更加温暖了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6f48b6254aefc4d1230866ad8c8b10386a06bbe87693f3fbe2cdbef776c0402",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cba062604f583f1d2fa8ff14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有通知送到了哦。\n如果可以的话，我能在旁边\n一起看看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6c113c211beba3785017d9dd42be3b22490da1fa62a5957dc43e42e5e287622",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ebe0203a5fe33231492a7b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "似乎有礼物送到了。\n我想，那一定是为了祝福\n努力着的你而送来的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a246159af553fc86ecf41d08be383a442893e0f72a15157cb8b07f148384d15e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:434d366ac5e5cb9897f8bb81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵…任务达成，\n恭喜你。\n真是非常出色的表现呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51241013e25c151025b2dcdc65995ad2b98488d61b979f7584c4cf204b088f14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4b91a5d51ac342927a932f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动似乎要开始了呢。\n如果你要着手准备的话，\n也能让我帮忙吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "68918123f3122c0ae90cad0ccb39358d8fac66079735b325728d53e74836d7f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18fcc9910ee5b94f6ad318e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动已经开始了呢。\n愿这段时间，能连结到你的笑容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e65bb295bd4778e18d3a138d6aeb3af6a424771ceee4c8d3cb26501171899dab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10019"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
